## GhostChat onion service — append to /etc/tor/torrc (setup-onion.sh does this for you)
## The app listens on 172.29.0.10:3000 only. Tor publishes it as a .onion address.
## Your server's real IP is never revealed to users, and users' IPs are never revealed to you.

HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/ghostchat/
HiddenServiceVersion 3
HiddenServicePort 80 172.29.0.10:3000

## Anti-DDoS: make attackers solve proof-of-work puzzles during floods (Tor 0.4.8+)
HiddenServicePoWDefensesEnabled 1
HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSDefense 1
HiddenServiceMaxStreams 200
HiddenServiceMaxStreamsCloseCircuit 1

SocksPort 0
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
Log notice stdout
